---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="GTA Weekly Bonuses | 2 Smokin' Barrels"
        description="Halloween enters its final week in Los Santos! Earn 3X rewards on Halloween Survivals and Slasher modes, claim a GTA$250,000 bonus from Survivals, and celebrate Día de Muertos with free gifts."
        image="https://2smokinbarrels.com/images/gta-bonuses-banner.jpg"
    >
    <main class="container">
       
        <header class="page-header">
            <h1 class="page-title">GTA Weekly Report</h1>
            <p class="date-range">October 29, 2026 — November 4, 2026</p>
            
            <div class="highlight-box highlight-box-left">
                <p>
                    A new GTA Online event starts on October 29 (available through November 4). <span class="highlight-text">Halloween</span> enters its final week! Play through November 4 to get the Brown Vintage Skull Mask and the Halloween Chute Bag. Complete 10 waves of a Survival without dying for <span class="highlight-pink">GTA$250,000</span> and the Slasher Clown Outfit. Plus, log in to celebrate Día de Muertos with three free gifts!
                </p>
            </div>
        </header>

        <!-- WEEKLY BONUSES GRID -->
        <div class="bonus-grid">
            <div class="bonus-card">
                <h3>Event Highlights & Challenges</h3>
                <div class="bonus-item"><strong>Weekly Challenge:</strong> Complete 10 waves in a Survival without dying to get the Slasher Clown Outfit and GTA$250,000</div>
                <div class="bonus-item"><strong>Halloween Challenge:</strong> Complete all Weekly Challenges through November 4 to receive GTA$2,000,000 (within 72 hours)</div>
                <div class="bonus-item"><strong>Free Clothing:</strong> Play GTA Online through November 4 to receive the Brown Vintage Skull Mask and the Halloween Chute Bag</div>
                <div class="bonus-item"><strong>Día de Muertos:</strong> Log in to receive the Día de Muertos Tee, Maritime Calaca Mask & Royal Calaca Mask</div>
            </div>

            <div class="bonus-card">
                <h3>Bonus GTA$ & RP</h3>
                <div class="bonus-item"><span class="multiplier">3X</span> <strong>GTA$ & RP:</strong> Halloween Featured Series (Slasher, Ramius - Slasher) & Halloween Survivals (Ludendorff Cemetery, Cayo Perico)</div>
                <div class="bonus-item"><span class="multiplier">3X</span> <strong>GTA$ & RP:</strong> Alien Survivals (6X for GTA+ Members)</div>
                <div class="bonus-item"><span class="multiplier">3X</span> <strong>GTA$ & RP:</strong> San Andreas Super Sport Series (Hotring Races, Random Transform Races) & Community Mission Series (PS5, Xbox Series X|S & PC Enhanced)</div>
                <div class="bonus-item"><span class="multiplier">2X</span> <strong>GTA$ & RP:</strong> Bail Office Standard & Most Wanted Targets, Dispatch Work, UFO Business Battles</div>
                <div class="bonus-item"><span class="multiplier">2X</span> <strong>GTA$ & RP:</strong> Jack O' Lanterns (4X for GTA+ Members)</div>
                <div class="bonus-item"><span class="multiplier">2X</span> <strong>GTA$:</strong> Ghosts Exposed (4X for GTA+ Members)</div>
            </div>

            <div class="bonus-card">
                <h3>Discounts & Gun Van</h3>
                <div class="bonus-item"><strong>40% OFF:</strong> Agency Properties (including Upgrades & Modifications), Albany Brigham, Albany Fränken Stange, Albany Lurcher, Declasse Tornado Rat Rod, and LCC Sanctus</div>
                <div class="bonus-item"><strong>30% OFF Vehicles:</strong> Bravado Gauntlet Classic, Invetero Coquette D10, Karin Futo GTX, MTL Dune, Pegassi Infernus Classic, Shitzu Keitora, Übermacht Zion Classic, Vapid Firebolt ASP, and Vapid FMJ</div>
                <div class="bonus-item"><strong>Gun Van (FREE):</strong> The Shocker</div>
                <div class="bonus-item"><strong>Gun Van (30% OFF):</strong> Service Carbine</div>
                <div class="bonus-item"><strong>Gun Van (50% OFF GTA+):</strong> Up-n-Atomizer, Unholy Hellbringer & Widowmaker</div>
                <div class="bonus-item"><strong>Gun Van (Standard):</strong> Precision Rifle, Combat Shotgun, El Strickler, Knife, Baseball Bat & Pipe Bombs</div>
            </div>

            <div class="bonus-card">
                <h3>Free Vehicles & Showrooms</h3>
                <div class="bonus-item"><strong>Lucky Wheel:</strong> Progen GP1</div>
                <div class="bonus-item"><strong>LS Car Meet Prize Ride:</strong> Karin Previon (Place Top 5 in the LS Car Meet Series for two days in a row)</div>
                <div class="bonus-item"><strong>Premium Deluxe Motorsport:</strong> Albany Brigham, Albany Fränken Stange, Albany Lurcher, Declasse Tornado Rat Rod & LCC Sanctus</div>
                <div class="bonus-item"><strong>Luxury Autos:</strong> Dewbauchee Rapid GT X & Übermacht Sentinel XS4</div>
            </div>

            <div class="bonus-card">
                <h3>Test Rides & Trials</h3>
                <div class="bonus-item"><strong>Test Track:</strong> Declasse Vamos, Dewbauchee Seven-70 & Ocelot Locust</div>
                <div class="bonus-item"><strong>Premium Test Ride (HSW):</strong> Maibatsu MonstroCiti</div>
                <div class="bonus-item"><strong>Premium Race:</strong> Wiwang Park</div>
                <div class="bonus-item"><strong>Time Trials:</strong> Route 68 (Standard) & East Vinewood to Vespucci Beach (HSW)</div>
            </div>
             
            <div class="bonus-card">
                <h3>Heists & Robberies</h3>
                <div class="bonus-item"><strong>Kortz Center Primary Targets:</strong> "I, Fruit", "Until Death" & "Gone To Seed"</div>
                <div class="bonus-item"><strong>FIB Priority File:</strong> The Project Breakaway File</div>
                <div class="bonus-item"><strong>Salvage Yard (Top Tier):</strong> The Gangbanger Robbery - Lampadati Cinquemila</div>
                <div class="bonus-item"><strong>Salvage Yard (Standard Tier):</strong> The Duggan Robbery - Albany Fränken Stange</div>
                <div class="bonus-item"><strong>Salvage Yard (Low Tier):</strong> The Podium Robbery - Karin Boor</div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- HALLOWEEN MONTH-LONG UNLOCKS SECTION -->
        <div class="event-panel">
            <h2>Halloween Month-Long Unlocks & Challenges</h2>
            
            <p class="event-panel-intro">
                Playing GTA Online throughout October treats you to free apparel and accessories, while completing increasingly difficult Weekly Challenges earns you spooky gifts and cash rewards.
            </p>
            <p class="event-panel-prize">
                <strong class="highlight-pink">Grand Prize Bonus:</strong> Complete all five Weekly Challenges throughout the month to earn an extra <strong>GTA$2,000,000 bonus</strong> (delivered within 72 hours of completion).
            </p>

            <h3>Week 1: October 1 – 7</h3>
            <ul>
                <li><strong>Login Unlock:</strong> Cheerleader Massacre 3 T-Shirt</li>
                <li><strong>Weekly Challenge:</strong> Secure two Bail Office Bounties to get the Green Vintage Skull Mask and GTA$100,000</li>
            </ul>

            <h3>Week 2: October 8 – 14</h3>
            <ul>
                <li><strong>Login Unlock:</strong> Twilight Knife T-Shirt</li>
                <li><strong>Weekly Challenge:</strong> Win in two Adversary modes to get the Pink Skull Emissive Mask and GTA$100,000</li>
            </ul>

            <h3>Week 3: October 15 – 21</h3>
            <ul>
                <li><strong>Login Unlock:</strong> Butchery and Other Hobbies T-Shirt</li>
                <li><strong>Weekly Challenge:</strong> Win three Races to get the Orange Glow Skeleton Onesie and GTA$100,000</li>
            </ul>

            <h3>Week 4: October 22 – 28</h3>
            <ul>
                <li><strong>Login Unlock:</strong> White & Red Tech Demon Mask</li>
                <li><strong>Weekly Challenge:</strong> Complete all waves of a Survival to get the Gray Space Interloper Outfit and GTA$150,000</li>
            </ul>

            <h3>Week 5: October 29 – November 4</h3>
            <ul>
                <li><strong>Login Unlock:</strong> Brown Vintage Skull Mask and the Halloween Chute Bag</li>
                <li><strong>Weekly Challenge:</strong> Complete 10 waves in a Survival without dying to get the Slasher Clown Outfit and GTA$250,000</li>
            </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="back-nav">
            <a href="/" class="back-link">&larr; Back to Home</a>
        </div>
    </main>
</Layout>